 for creator-designated asset packs; check each download",[1132],{"_47":1133,"_24":1127,"_269":1134},"Browse creator packs","Check the exact pack: free Standard downloads and paid Pro or Source editions can contain different files.",[1136],{"_47":271,"_24":1127},"Low-poly environments, characters and animated model packs",[282],[150,79],[152,83],[298],{"_47":1133,"_24":1127,"_269":1134},[1146,1147],[1119,1120],[1116,1117],{"_47":1126,"_24":1127},{"_47":1125,"_24":703},"testing:kenney","kenney","Kenney","适合小型测试场景、资产替换、碰撞和 UI 回归的 CC0 资源起点。","/zh/testing/kenney/",{"_18":1149,"_20":1150,"_16":836,"_284":1197,"_281":1198,"_278":1194,"_287":1151,"_273":1190,"_266":1199,"_263":262,"_260":1186,"_256":417,"_252":758,"_243":1200,"_240":1180,"_235":1201,"_229":1202,"_223":1173,"_220":219},[1155,1156,1157,1158,1159,1160,1161,1162,1163,1164,1165,1166,1167,1168,1169,1170,1171,1172],{"_45":20,"_49":1150,"_51":20,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":76,"_49":1151,"_51":287,"_53":-7,"_55":34},{"_45":46,"_47":285,"_49":835,"_51":16,"_53":81,"_55":34},{"_45":224,"_47":78,"_226":233,"_58":1196,"_51":284,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":279,"_226":233,"_58":1195,"_51":281,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":276,"_49":1194,"_51":278,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":56,"_47":271,"_58":1192,"_51":273,"_53":-7},{"_45":56,"_47":264,"_58":1187,"_51":266,"_53":-7},{"_45":46,"_47":261,"_49":262,"_51":263,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":258,"_49":1186,"_51":260,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":254,"_49":403,"_51":256,"_53":257,"_55":34},{"_45":56,"_47":250,"_58":1184,"_51":252,"_53":-7},{"_45":56,"_47":241,"_58":1181,"_51":243,"_53":-7},{"_45":46,"_47":238,"_49":1180,"_51":240,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":232,"_226":233,"_58":1177,"_51":235,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":225,"_226":227,"_58":1174,"_51":229,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":221,"_49":1173,"_51":223,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":218,"_49":219,"_51":220,"_53":81,"_55":95},"Not every pack contains animation or a humanoid rig. No pack was imported locally in this review.",[1175,1176],"Choose one small pack and retain its included license file.","Import the pack into a versioned test project and record the import settings.",[1178,1179],"Replace a sprite or model and check scale, collision and material references.","Run a fixed UI or tilemap scene and compare screenshots.","Use the CC0 pack files as the basis for a redistributable test fixture. This does not make the website, branding or separately sold software CC0.",[1182],{"_47":1183,"_24":758},"Creator licensing FAQ",[1185],{"_47":250,"_24":758},"CC0 for the asset packs",[1188],{"_47":1189,"_24":1190,"_269":1191},"Browse free asset packs","https://kenney.nl/assets","Individual asset packs are free; optional bundles and tools are separate products.",[1193],{"_47":271,"_24":1190},"Sprites, tiles, UI, audio and 3D model packs",[833,282],[150,79],[152,83],[845,298],{"_47":1189,"_24":1190,"_269":1191},[1203],[1178,1179],[1175,1176],{"_47":1183,"_24":758},"testing:unity-ml-agents","unity-ml-agents","Unity ML-Agents","官方工具与示例场景，覆盖物理、视觉控制、合作与竞争，可将自定义 Unity 场景接入 Python 策略和自动化测试。","/zh/testing/unity-ml-agents/",{"_18":1205,"_20":1206,"_16":1270,"_284":1271,"_281":1272,"_278":1266,"_287":1207,"_273":1265,"_266":1273,"_263":1257,"_260":1256,"_256":1274,"_252":1254,"_243":1275,"_240":1238,"_235":1276,"_229":1277,"_223":1229,"_220":219},[1211,1212,1213,1214,1215,1216,1217,1218,1219,1220,1221,1222,1223,1224,1225,1226,1227,1228],{"_45":20,"_49":1206,"_51":20,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":76,"_49":1207,"_51":287,"_53":-7,"_55":34},{"_45":46,"_47":285,"_49":1269,"_51":16,"_53":81,"_55":34},{"_45":224,"_47":78,"_226":233,"_58":1268,"_51":284,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":279,"_226":233,"_58":1267,"_51":281,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":276,"_49":1266,"_51":278,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":56,"_47":271,"_58":1263,"_51":273,"_53":-7},{"_45":56,"_47":264,"_58":1258,"_51":266,"_53":-7},{"_45":46,"_47":261,"_49":1257,"_51":263,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":258,"_49":1256,"_51":260,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":254,"_49":1255,"_51":256,"_53":257,"_55":34},{"_45":56,"_47":250,"_58":1252,"_51":252,"_53":-7},{"_45":56,"_47":241,"_58":1239,"_51":243,"_53":-7},{"_45":46,"_47":238,"_49":1238,"_51":240,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":232,"_226":233,"_58":1234,"_51":235,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":225,"_226":227,"_58":1230,"_51":229,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":221,"_49":1229,"_51":223,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":218,"_49":219,"_51":220,"_53":81,"_55":95},"Source reviewed, not run here. Editor eligibility, platform builds and version compatibility need local checks. The develop branch is not a stable evaluation baseline.",[1231,1232,1233],"Select a release tag, install its supported Unity editor and open the included Project.","Install the matching com.unity.ml-agents package and Python environment package versions.","Open an example scene and connect a policy; route actions by behavior and agent_id, and read both DecisionSteps and TerminalSteps. Python step advances to the next decision, not necessarily one physics frame.",[1235,1236,1237],"Compare physics-task success with fixed observations, decisions and reset rules.","Change a C# agent or scene and verify sensors, rewards and episode termination.","Import a replacement rig or collider and check control stability and visual observations.","The toolkit supports agent research and automated testing; its Apache license does not replace editor or third-party asset terms.",[1240,1241,1242,1243],{"_47":1250,"_24":1251},{"_47":1248,"_24":1249},{"_47":1246,"_24":1247},{"_47":1244,"_24":1245},"Unity editor terms","https://unity.com/legal/editor-terms-of-service/software","Third-party notices","https://github.com/Unity-Technologies/ml-agents/blob/develop/Third%20Party%20Notices.md","Release 23 low-level decision and terminal contract","https://github.com/Unity-Technologies/ml-agents/blob/a2777719560e4676be99e2ea128c5eb1fbeb3dbb/com.unity.ml-agents/Documentation~/Python-LLAPI.md","Official toolkit and release compatibility","https://github.com/Unity-Technologies/ml-agents#readme",[1253],{"_47":250,"_24":1254},"https://github.com/Unity-Technologies/ml-agents/blob/develop/LICENSE.md","引擎专用许可","Check bundled notices and any added scene assets. The Unity editor and external store assets have separate terms.","Apache-2.0 for the toolkit, with third-party notices.",[1259],{"_47":1260,"_24":1261,"_269":1262},"Free toolkit; Unity editor required","https://github.com/Unity-Technologies/ml-agents/releases","Choose one release and match its Unity package, Python packages and supported editor version.",[1264],{"_47":271,"_24":1265},"https://github.com/Unity-Technologies/ml-agents","Unity · C# · Python · sensors and agent actions",[833,282],[150,116,79],"AI 评估环境","environment",[152,118,83],[845,298],{"_47":1260,"_24":1261,"_269":1262},"engine",[1278,1279,1280,1281],[1235,1236,1237],[1231,1232,1233],{"_47":1250,"_24":1251},{"_47":1248,"_24":1249},{"_47":1246,"_24":1247},{"_47":1244,"_24":1245},"testing:godot-rl-agents","godot-rl-agents","Godot RL Agents","将可编辑 Godot 游戏连接到 Python 代理，适合在自有场景中修改玩法、暴露观察并评估 NPC 控制。","/zh/testing/godot-rl-agents/",{"_18":1283,"_20":1284,"_16":1270,"_284":1342,"_281":1343,"_278":1339,"_287":1285,"_273":1338,"_266":1344,"_263":1331,"_260":1330,"_256":961,"_252":1329,"_243":1345,"_240":1316,"_235":1346,"_229":1347,"_223":1307,"_220":219},[1289,1290,1291,1292,1293,1294,1295,1296,1297,1298,1299,1300,1301,1302,1303,1304,1305,1306],{"_45":20,"_49":1284,"_51":20,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":76,"_49":1285,"_51":287,"_53":-7,"_55":34},{"_45":46,"_47":285,"_49":1269,"_51":16,"_53":81,"_55":34},{"_45":224,"_47":78,"_226":233,"_58":1341,"_51":284,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":279,"_226":233,"_58":1340,"_51":281,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":276,"_49":1339,"_51":278,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":56,"_47":271,"_58":1336,"_51":273,"_53":-7},{"_45":56,"_47":264,"_58":1332,"_51":266,"_53":-7},{"_45":46,"_47":261,"_49":1331,"_51":263,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":258,"_49":1330,"_51":260,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":254,"_49":946,"_51":256,"_53":257,"_55":34},{"_45":56,"_47":250,"_58":1327,"_51":252,"_53":-7},{"_45":56,"_47":241,"_58":1317,"_51":243,"_53":-7},{"_45":46,"_47":238,"_49":1316,"_51":240,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":232,"_226":233,"_58":1312,"_51":235,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":225,"_226":227,"_58":1308,"_51":229,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":221,"_49":1307,"_51":223,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":218,"_49":219,"_51":220,"_53":81,"_55":95},"Source reviewed, not run here. The inspected bridge sends env_seed when launching a binary, but reset(seed=...) sends only a reset message. Editor runs need scene/plugin seed control; validate reset repeatability rather than assuming the Python argument reseeds Godot.",[1309,1310,1311],"Install godot-rl in a Python environment and download a documented example such as JumperHard.","Use the matching Godot 4 .NET editor for the documented editor example; import the project.","Run the repository Stable Baselines 3 example, or adapt its environment interface to a fixed policy.",[1313,1314,1315],"Change movement or reward logic, establish reset/replay repeatability for that scene, then compare fixed input rollouts.","Test sensors, action scaling and Python-to-game synchronization.","Replace a character or collider and verify that observations and control still work.","Designed for learning and automated gameplay testing. Keep imported-model rights and example attributions alongside the MIT toolkit license.",[1318,1319,1320],{"_47":1325,"_24":1326},{"_47":1323,"_24":1324},{"_47":1321,"_24":1322},"Pinned binary-launch and reset seed behavior","https://github.com/edbeeching/godot_rl_agents/blob/207b6f476f5846f33d08b92c7a350147e7b78bf5/godot_rl/core/godot_env.py","Example asset attribution","https://github.com/edbeeching/godot_rl_agents#license","Editor and exported-game workflow","https://github.com/edbeeching/godot_rl_agents#quickstart-guide",[1328],{"_47":250,"_24":1329},"https://github.com/edbeeching/godot_rl_agents/blob/main/LICENSE","Example assets can have separate notices: the Cartoon Plane model is CC BY 4.0.","MIT for Godot RL Agents; Godot is also MIT.",[1333],{"_47":1334,"_24":1326,"_269":1335},"Free toolkit and example projects","Install godot-rl and import an example; editor operation avoids needing a prebuilt game binary.",[1337],{"_47":271,"_24":1338},"https://github.com/edbeeching/godot_rl_agents","Godot 4 · Python · game sensors and action bridge",[833,282],[150,116,79],[152,118,83],[845,298],{"_47":1334,"_24":1326,"_269":1335},[1348,1349,1350],[1313,1314,1315],[1309,1310,1311],{"_47":1325,"_24":1326},{"_47":1323,"_24":1324},{"_47":1321,"_24":1322},"testing:nethack-learning-environment","nethack-learning-environment","NetHack Learning Environment","面向探索、背包、战术选择和长期规划的复杂 Roguelike 接口，应使用持续维护的 NetHack-LE 组织版本，而不是已归档的 Facebook 仓库。","/zh/testing/nethack-learning-environment/",{"_18":1352,"_20":1353,"_16":1270,"_284":1412,"_281":1413,"_278":1409,"_287":1354,"_273":1408,"_266":1414,"_263":1400,"_260":1399,"_256":417,"_252":1398,"_243":1415,"_240":1385,"_235":1416,"_229":1417,"_223":1376,"_220":219},[1358,1359,1360,1361,1362,1363,1364,1365,1366,1367,1368,1369,1370,1371,1372,1373,1374,1375],{"_45":20,"_49":1353,"_51":20,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":76,"_49":1354,"_51":287,"_53":-7,"_55":34},{"_45":46,"_47":285,"_49":1269,"_51":16,"_53":81,"_55":34},{"_45":224,"_47":78,"_226":233,"_58":1411,"_51":284,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":279,"_226":233,"_58":1410,"_51":281,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":276,"_49":1409,"_51":278,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":56,"_47":271,"_58":1406,"_51":273,"_53":-7},{"_45":56,"_47":264,"_58":1401,"_51":266,"_53":-7},{"_45":46,"_47":261,"_49":1400,"_51":263,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":258,"_49":1399,"_51":260,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":254,"_49":403,"_51":256,"_53":257,"_55":34},{"_45":56,"_47":250,"_58":1396,"_51":252,"_53":-7},{"_45":56,"_47":241,"_58":1386,"_51":243,"_53":-7},{"_45":46,"_47":238,"_49":1385,"_51":240,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":232,"_226":233,"_58":1381,"_51":235,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":225,"_226":227,"_58":1377,"_51":229,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":221,"_49":1376,"_51":223,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":218,"_49":219,"_51":220,"_53":81,"_55":95},"Source reviewed, not run here. Native tools may be required. In the inspected code, reset(seed=...) seeds Gymnasium but does not set NetHack RNGs; use the explicit seed interface. NetHackChallenge deliberately disallows seed changes. Terminal/glyph observations are not RGB game frames.",[1378,1379,1380],"Prepare Python 3.10+, CMake 3.28+ and the platform build prerequisites documented upstream.","Install nle, then run python -m nle.scripts.play --mode random.","Create NetHackScore-v0 with fixed observation_keys, actions and fix_moon_phase=True; before reset, call env.unwrapped.seed with recorded core, disp, reseed=False and optional lgen values.",[1382,1383,1384],"Measure staircase or score-task progress with a fixed turn budget.","Test inventory decisions and recovery after invalid actions.","Modify a task reward or termination rule and replay baseline rollouts.","An AI research interface; distinguish terminal rendering, symbols, text messages and internal state so planning results remain comparable.",[1387,1388,1389],{"_47":1394,"_24":1395},{"_47":1392,"_24":1393},{"_47":1390,"_24":1391},"Pinned observation, seed and reset implementation","https://github.com/NetHack-LE/nle/blob/2319f2989f0035685017e9ea13c83b2546fe477c/nle/env/base.py","Archived upstream repository","https://github.com/facebookresearch/nle","Maintained source, installation and play scripts","https://github.com/NetHack-LE/nle#readme",[1397],{"_47":250,"_24":1398},"https://github.com/NetHack-LE/nle/blob/main/LICENSE","Bundled NetHack data follows repository notices; external tilesets are separate.","NetHack General Public License; preserve notices and follow source/distribution obligations.",[1402],{"_47":1403,"_24":1404,"_269":1405},"Free package and source","https://github.com/NetHack-LE/nle#installation","Native compilation prerequisites may be needed; the repository includes interactive and random-agent scripts.",[1407],{"_47":271,"_24":1408},"https://github.com/NetHack-LE/nle","Python · C / C++ · Gymnasium · NetHack",[833],[150,116],[152,118],[845],{"_47":1403,"_24":1404,"_269":1405},[1418,1419,1420],[1382,1383,1384],[1378,1379,1380],{"_47":1394,"_24":1395},{"_47":1392,"_24":1393},{"_47":1390,"_24":1391},"testing:vizdoom","提供可编程动作与情景控制的第一人称环境，适合瞄准、导航、战斗和记忆任务；采用 3D 视角及 Doom 风格渲染技术。",{"_18":121,"_20":108,"_16":1270,"_284":1479,"_281":1480,"_278":1476,"_287":1422,"_273":1475,"_266":1481,"_263":1467,"_260":1466,"_256":961,"_252":1465,"_243":1482,"_240":1452,"_235":1483,"_229":1484,"_223":1443,"_220":219},[1425,1426,1427,1428,1429,1430,1431,1432,1433,1434,1435,1436,1437,1438,1439,1440,1441,1442],{"_45":20,"_49":108,"_51":20,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":76,"_49":1422,"_51":287,"_53":-7,"_55":34},{"_45":46,"_47":285,"_49":1269,"_51":16,"_53":81,"_55":34},{"_45":224,"_47":78,"_226":233,"_58":1478,"_51":284,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":279,"_226":233,"_58":1477,"_51":281,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":276,"_49":1476,"_51":278,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":56,"_47":271,"_58":1473,"_51":273,"_53":-7},{"_45":56,"_47":264,"_58":1468,"_51":266,"_53":-7},{"_45":46,"_47":261,"_49":1467,"_51":263,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":258,"_49":1466,"_51":260,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":254,"_49":946,"_51":256,"_53":257,"_55":34},{"_45":56,"_47":250,"_58":1463,"_51":252,"_53":-7},{"_45":56,"_47":241,"_58":1453,"_51":243,"_53":-7},{"_45":46,"_47":238,"_49":1452,"_51":240,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":232,"_226":233,"_58":1448,"_51":235,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":225,"_226":227,"_58":1444,"_51":229,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":221,"_49":1443,"_51":223,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":218,"_49":219,"_51":220,"_53":81,"_55":95},"Source reviewed, not run here. ViZDoom 1.3+ macOS wheels require Apple Silicon and macOS 14+; the documented Intel wheel route is 1.2.4. Wrapper timeout handling changed in 1.3.0, so pin the version and timeout option. WAD rights remain scenario-specific.",[1445,1446,1447],"Install vizdoom in a supported Python environment; check wheel support for your OS and architecture.","Start from the repository Python examples and a bundled basic scenario.","For the Gymnasium wrapper, fix config, buffers, button space and frame_skip; use reset(seed=...) and log terminated and truncated separately, including treat_episode_timeout_as_truncation.",[1449,1450,1451],"Evaluate aiming accuracy, navigation completion and survival at a fixed action frequency.","Compare pixel-only control with privileged buffers explicitly marked as separate tracks.","Edit a scenario and check spawn, objectives, rewards and termination.","Built for AI experiments; this does not grant rights to arbitrary WADs. Record which scenario, base assets and licenses an evaluation uses.",[1454,1455,1456],{"_47":1461,"_24":1462},{"_47":1459,"_24":1460},{"_47":1457,"_24":1458},"Pinned Gymnasium timing, seed and timeout contract","https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/ViZDoom/blob/909e834264e42f136f59f80e72e95d8146f40e21/gymnasium_wrapper/base_gymnasium_env.py","Freedoom, WADs and custom scenarios","https://vizdoom.farama.org/faq/","Package installation and examples","https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/ViZDoom#python-quick-start",[1464],{"_47":250,"_24":1465},"https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/ViZDoom#license","Freedoom is the default asset set. Original Doom / Doom II WADs are not supplied and require their own rights.","Original ViZDoom contributions are MIT; underlying ZDoom components have separate licenses.",[1469],{"_47":1470,"_24":1471,"_269":1472},"Free package with Freedoom assets","https://vizdoom.farama.org/","pip install vizdoom; begin with a bundled scenario rather than a commercial Doom WAD.",[1474],{"_47":271,"_24":1475},"https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/ViZDoom","Python / C++ · Doom / ZDoom · Gymnasium",[282],[150,116],[152,118],[298],{"_47":1470,"_24":1471,"_269":1472},[1485,1486,1487],[1449,1450,1451],[1445,1446,1447],{"_47":1461,"_24":1462},{"_47":1459,"_24":1460},{"_47":1457,"_24":1458},"testing:craftax","craftax","Craftax","支持向量化模拟的生存与合成环境，适合较长动作依赖，以及像素策略与符号策略的比较。","/zh/testing/craftax/",{"_18":1489,"_20":1490,"_16":1270,"_284":1548,"_281":1549,"_278":1545,"_287":1491,"_273":1544,"_266":1550,"_263":1537,"_260":1536,"_256":417,"_252":1535,"_243":1551,"_240":1522,"_235":1552,"_229":1553,"_223":1513,"_220":219},[1495,1496,1497,1498,1499,1500,1501,1502,1503,1504,1505,1506,1507,1508,1509,1510,1511,1512],{"_45":20,"_49":1490,"_51":20,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":76,"_49":1491,"_51":287,"_53":-7,"_55":34},{"_45":46,"_47":285,"_49":1269,"_51":16,"_53":81,"_55":34},{"_45":224,"_47":78,"_226":233,"_58":1547,"_51":284,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":279,"_226":233,"_58":1546,"_51":281,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":276,"_49":1545,"_51":278,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":56,"_47":271,"_58":1542,"_51":273,"_53":-7},{"_45":56,"_47":264,"_58":1538,"_51":266,"_53":-7},{"_45":46,"_47":261,"_49":1537,"_51":263,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":258,"_49":1536,"_51":260,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":254,"_49":403,"_51":256,"_53":257,"_55":34},{"_45":56,"_47":250,"_58":1533,"_51":252,"_53":-7},{"_45":56,"_47":241,"_58":1523,"_51":243,"_53":-7},{"_45":46,"_47":238,"_49":1522,"_51":240,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":232,"_226":233,"_58":1518,"_51":235,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":225,"_226":227,"_58":1514,"_51":229,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":221,"_49":1513,"_51":223,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":218,"_49":219,"_51":220,"_53":81,"_55":95},"Source reviewed, not run here. JIT startup is slow. With auto_reset=True, a done step returns the next episode observation/state alongside the previous episode reward/done/info. With auto_reset=False, handle termination before stepping again.",[1515,1516,1517],"Run pip install craftax in an isolated Python environment.","Run play_craftax or play_craftax_classic for manual play.","Select Craftax-Pixels-v1 or Craftax-Symbolic-v1 explicitly; keep full Craftax and Craftax-Classic separate. Supply distinct JAX keys to reset and step, and record the auto_reset setting.",[1519,1520,1521],"Compare survival and crafting progress using identical seeded worlds.","Separate image-only policies from symbolic-state policies.","Modify a block or recipe, invalidate texture caches when necessary, and check reset behavior.","Fix observation mode, PRNG keys, episode handling and package version. Version changes affect comparability: 1.5.0 fixes first-planted-plant growth, and 1.6.0 fixes Craftax-Classic death rewards.",[1524,1525,1526],{"_47":1531,"_24":1532},{"_47":1529,"_24":1530},{"_47":1527,"_24":1528},"Pinned auto-reset transition implementation","https://github.com/MichaelTMatthews/Craftax/blob/c3c2e0d038c4e641f9481320c158f457f30c28f3/craftax/environment_base/environment_bases.py","Game tutorial","https://github.com/MichaelTMatthews/Craftax/blob/main/tutorial.md","Installation, API and reset caveats","https://github.com/MichaelTMatthews/Craftax#readme",[1534],{"_47":250,"_24":1535},"https://github.com/MichaelTMatthews/Craftax/blob/main/LICENSE","Repository material under its MIT notice; added assets need separate records.","MIT.",[1539],{"_47":1540,"_24":1532,"_269":1541},"Free Python package","CPU JAX is installed by default; accelerator support needs the correct JAX build.",[1543],{"_47":271,"_24":1544},"https://github.com/MichaelTMatthews/Craftax","Python · JAX · gymnax-style API",[833],[150,116],[152,118],[845],{"_47":1540,"_24":1532,"_269":1541},[1554,1555,1556],[1519,1520,1521],[1515,1516,1517],{"_47":1531,"_24":1532},{"_47":1529,"_24":1530},{"_47":1527,"_24":1528},"testing:crafter","结合探索、生命、采集、建造与合成的小型生存世界，成就进度可揭示游玩代理的不同能力。",{"_18":120,"_20":110,"_16":1270,"_284":1617,"_281":1618,"_278":1614,"_287":1558,"_273":1613,"_266":1619,"_263":1537,"_260":1605,"_256":417,"_252":1604,"_243":1620,"_240":1588,"_235":1621,"_229":1622,"_223":1579,"_220":219},[1561,1562,1563,1564,1565,1566,1567,1568,1569,1570,1571,1572,1573,1574,1575,1576,1577,1578],{"_45":20,"_49":110,"_51":20,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":76,"_49":1558,"_51":287,"_53":-7,"_55":34},{"_45":46,"_47":285,"_49":1269,"_51":16,"_53":81,"_55":34},{"_45":224,"_47":78,"_226":233,"_58":1616,"_51":284,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":279,"_226":233,"_58":1615,"_51":281,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":276,"_49":1614,"_51":278,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":56,"_47":271,"_58":1611,"_51":273,"_53":-7},{"_45":56,"_47":264,"_58":1606,"_51":266,"_53":-7},{"_45":46,"_47":261,"_49":1537,"_51":263,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":258,"_49":1605,"_51":260,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":254,"_49":403,"_51":256,"_53":257,"_55":34},{"_45":56,"_47":250,"_58":1602,"_51":252,"_53":-7},{"_45":56,"_47":241,"_58":1589,"_51":243,"_53":-7},{"_45":46,"_47":238,"_49":1588,"_51":240,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":232,"_226":233,"_58":1584,"_51":235,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":225,"_226":227,"_58":1580,"_51":229,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":221,"_49":1579,"_51":223,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":218,"_49":219,"_51":220,"_53":81,"_55":95},"Source reviewed, not run here. Classic Gym reset returns only an observation and step returns four values. reset has no seed argument; matching constructor seeds alone is insufficient unless episode/reset order also matches.",[1581,1582,1583],"Install crafter and pygame in an isolated Python environment.","Run python -m crafter.run_gui for manual controls, then use CrafterReward-v1 for automation.","Set the seed when constructing the environment and record the episode index; use crafter.Recorder with a nonempty output directory, save_stats=True and save_episode=True to retain completed-episode statistics and action trajectories.",[1585,1586,1587],"Measure survival and achievement success over held-out world seeds.","Plan a resource-to-tool sequence with a fixed interaction budget.","Change a recipe and verify that collection, crafting and achievement recording remain consistent.","Designed for agent evaluation. For pixel-only tests, withhold info.semantic, inventory and player_pos from the policy; those expose structured state beyond the RGB observation. Keep published benchmark budgets separate from custom VLM protocols.",[1590,1591,1592,1593],{"_47":1600,"_24":1601},{"_47":1598,"_24":1599},{"_47":1596,"_24":1597},{"_47":1594,"_24":1595},"Pinned completed-episode recorder contract","https://github.com/danijar/crafter/blob/e04542a2159f1aad3d4c5ad52e8185717380ee3a/crafter/recorder.py","Pinned reset, seed and privileged info contract","https://github.com/danijar/crafter/blob/e04542a2159f1aad3d4c5ad52e8185717380ee3a/crafter/env.py","Achievement-based evaluation","https://github.com/danijar/crafter#evaluation","Observation, actions and recorder","https://github.com/danijar/crafter#interface",[1603],{"_47":250,"_24":1604},"https://github.com/danijar/crafter/blob/main/LICENSE","Repository material under its MIT notice; track any replacement art separately.",[1607],{"_47":1608,"_24":1609,"_269":1610},"Free package and playable GUI","https://github.com/danijar/crafter#play-yourself","pip install crafter pygame; the GUI and evaluation environment run locally.",[1612],{"_47":271,"_24":1613},"https://github.com/danijar/crafter","Python · Gym interface · pixel survival",[833],[150,116],[152,118],[845],{"_47":1608,"_24":1609,"_269":1610},[1623,1624,1625,1626],[1585,1586,1587],[1581,1582,1583],{"_47":1600,"_24":1601},{"_47":1598,"_24":1599},{"_47":1596,"_24":1597},{"_47":1594,"_24":1595},"testing:minigrid","包含钥匙、门、物体和部分观察的小型导航与语言落地任务，适合作为可重复规划测试的初始基线。",{"_18":119,"_20":112,"_16":1270,"_284":1684,"_281":1685,"_278":1681,"_287":1628,"_273":1680,"_266":1686,"_26