 and build instructions","https://github.com/endless-sky/endless-sky",[2429],{"_47":250,"_24":2424},"Multiple artwork and audio licenses; the repository copyright file identifies authors and terms.","GPLv3; third-party code and files may have their own notices.",[2433],{"_47":1888,"_24":2425,"_269":2434},"Free Steam and desktop releases; plugins offer a lighter starting point than rebuilding the engine.",[2436],{"_47":271,"_24":2427},"C++ / space exploration / data-driven content",[833],[150,116],[152,118],[845],{"_47":1888,"_24":2425,"_269":2434},[2446,2447,2448],[2415,2416,2417],[2411,2412,2413],{"_47":2426,"_24":2427},{"_47":1876,"_24":2425},{"_47":2423,"_24":2424},"testing:supertux","完整平台游戏，适合在实际原生代码库中测试跳跃时序、碰撞、关卡编辑及画面与输入回归。",{"_18":154,"_20":144,"_16":1752,"_284":2504,"_281":2505,"_278":2501,"_287":2450,"_273":2489,"_266":2506,"_263":2493,"_260":2492,"_256":961,"_252":2489,"_243":2507,"_240":2480,"_235":2508,"_229":2509,"_223":2471,"_220":219},[2453,2454,2455,2456,2457,2458,2459,2460,2461,2462,2463,2464,2465,2466,2467,2468,2469,2470],{"_45":20,"_49":144,"_51":20,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":76,"_49":2450,"_51":287,"_53":-7,"_55":34},{"_45":46,"_47":285,"_49":1751,"_51":16,"_53":81,"_55":34},{"_45":224,"_47":78,"_226":233,"_58":2503,"_51":284,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":279,"_226":233,"_58":2502,"_51":281,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":276,"_49":2501,"_51":278,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":56,"_47":271,"_58":2499,"_51":273,"_53":-7},{"_45":56,"_47":264,"_58":2494,"_51":266,"_53":-7},{"_45":46,"_47":261,"_49":2493,"_51":263,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":258,"_49":2492,"_51":260,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":254,"_49":946,"_51":256,"_53":257,"_55":34},{"_45":56,"_47":250,"_58":2490,"_51":252,"_53":-7},{"_45":56,"_47":241,"_58":2481,"_51":243,"_53":-7},{"_45":46,"_47":238,"_49":2480,"_51":240,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":232,"_226":233,"_58":2476,"_51":235,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":225,"_226":227,"_58":2472,"_51":229,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":221,"_49":2471,"_51":223,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":218,"_49":219,"_51":220,"_53":81,"_55":95},"Not installed or run in this research pass. It has no ready-made Gymnasium evaluation contract; observation, action timing and reset/success detection need a harness.",[2473,2474,2475],"Start with the free binary and a fixed level to establish a control baseline.","For code edits, follow the repository build instructions with CMake and the required C++ dependencies.","Pin the game version, level, settings and input timing before comparing agents.",[2477,2478,2479],"Modify jump acceleration or a collision edge case, then replay a fixed level.","Measure completion rate, deaths, missed jumps and time for a screen-based controller.","Change a level and verify checkpoints, enemies and completion conditions.","Code access supports instrumented experiments, but GPL code and CC BY-SA game data carry different obligations. Keep any redistributed screenshots, maps or data exports traceable to their source licenses.",[2482,2483,2484],{"_47":2488,"_24":2489},{"_47":1876,"_24":2487},{"_47":2485,"_24":2486},"Independent downloads","https://www.supertux.org/download.html","https://store.steampowered.com/app/1572920/SuperTux/","Official game source and licensing","https://github.com/SuperTux/supertux",[2491],{"_47":250,"_24":2489},"Most game data uses CC BY-SA; individual files and third-party components have additional notices.","GNU GPL; inspect the pinned version and component notices before distributing a modified build.",[2495],{"_47":2496,"_24":2497,"_269":2498},"Play official browser build","https://play.supertux.org/","Official browser play, a free Steam release and independent desktop downloads are available. Building modified core code requires the native toolchain.",[2500],{"_47":271,"_24":2489},"C++ / CMake / 2D platformer",[833],[150,116],[152,118],[845],{"_47":2496,"_24":2497,"_269":2498},[2510,2511,2512],[2477,2478,2479],[2473,2474,2475],{"_47":2488,"_24":2489},{"_47":1876,"_24":2487},{"_47":2485,"_24":2486},"testing:godot-demos","小型独立引擎项目，覆盖角色控制、物理、导航、网络、动画及导入导出，可作为回归测试起点。",{"_18":153,"_20":146,"_16":1752,"_284":2567,"_281":2568,"_278":2564,"_287":2514,"_273":2553,"_266":2569,"_263":2557,"_260":2556,"_256":417,"_252":2549,"_243":2570,"_240":2544,"_235":2571,"_229":2572,"_223":2535,"_220":219},[2517,2518,2519,2520,2521,2522,2523,2524,2525,2526,2527,2528,2529,2530,2531,2532,2533,2534],{"_45":20,"_49":146,"_51":20,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":76,"_49":2514,"_51":287,"_53":-7,"_55":34},{"_45":46,"_47":285,"_49":1751,"_51":16,"_53":81,"_55":34},{"_45":224,"_47":78,"_226":233,"_58":2566,"_51":284,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":279,"_226":233,"_58":2565,"_51":281,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":276,"_49":2564,"_51":278,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":56,"_47":271,"_58":2562,"_51":273,"_53":-7},{"_45":56,"_47":264,"_58":2558,"_51":266,"_53":-7},{"_45":46,"_47":261,"_49":2557,"_51":263,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":258,"_49":2556,"_51":260,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":254,"_49":403,"_51":256,"_53":257,"_55":34},{"_45":56,"_47":250,"_58":2554,"_51":252,"_53":-7},{"_45":56,"_47":241,"_58":2545,"_51":243,"_53":-7},{"_45":46,"_47":238,"_49":2544,"_51":240,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":232,"_226":233,"_58":2540,"_51":235,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":224,"_47":225,"_226":227,"_58":2536,"_51":229,"_53":-7,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":221,"_49":2535,"_51":223,"_53":54,"_55":95},{"_45":46,"_47":218,"_49":219,"_51":220,"_53":81,"_55":95},"Not installed or run in this research pass. Hosted web demos redeploy from master on every commit, so their URLs are not immutable baselines. Pin a compatible source commit for repeatable tests; the development branch and web renderer can differ from stable desktop behavior.",[2537,2538,2539],"Choose a stable demo branch or release compatible with the installed Godot version; pin its commit.","Download one demo directory, import its project.godot and run its main scene.","Save the engine version, scene, input sequence and expected result alongside the baseline.",[2541,2542,2543],"Change one movement or collision rule and verify the original scene still starts and completes its objective.","Import a known model or animation, then compare material loading, scale, skeleton mapping and exported behavior.","Replay the same input sequence and record screenshots, errors and task completion.","A useful open-license baseline for code editing and automated playtests. Record licenses of any additional assets or plugins rather than treating the demo license as a grant for unrelated data.",[2546,2547,2548],{"_47":2552,"_24":2553},{"_47":2550,"_24":2551},{"_47":2219,"_24":2549},"https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/blob/master/LICENSE.md","Official browser builds","https://godotengine.github.io/godot-demo-projects/","Official source and branch guidance","https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects",[2555],{"_47":250,"_24":2549},"Repository MIT license applies unless an individual demo or bundled resource states otherwise; keep local attribution notices.","MIT; retain the repository license and notices.",[2559],{"_47":2560,"_24":2551,"_269":2561},"Play browser demos","Free browser builds and downloadable source projects. Browser exports cover a subset of the repository.",[2563],{"_47":271,"_24":2553},"Godot / GDScript / C#",[833,282],[150,116,79],[152,118,83],[845,298],{"_47":2560,"_24":2551,"_269":2561},[2573,2574,2575],[2541,2542,2543],[2537,2538,2539],{"_47":2552,"_24":2553},{"_47":2550,"_24":2551},{"_47":2219,"_24":2549},{"_2577":2578},"documents",{"_95":2579,"_34":2580},[2582,2586,2587,2588,2585,2589,2590,2591,2592,2593,2594,2595,2596,2597,2598,2599,2600,2601,2602,2603,2604,2605,2606,2607,2608,2609,2610,2611,2612,2613,2614,2615,2616,2617,2618,2619,2620,2584,2621,2583,2622,2623,2624,2625,2626,2627,2628,2629,2630,2631,2632,2633,2634,2635,2636,2637,2638,2639,2640,2641,2642],[2581,2582,2583,2584,2585],"reading-guide","practical-guide"